function test(n){$("#loading").text(n)}function changePaged(n){$(".page0"+n+" div").css({visibility:"hidden"});$(".page").removeClass("active");n+=1;$(".page0"+n+"").addClass("active");$(".page0"+n+" div").css({visibility:"visible"});$(".page0"+(n+1)+" div").css({visibility:"hidden"});activityStatisticalLog(n)}function draw(){requestWaitDivShow();$.ajax({async:!1,url:"/WeixinService/activity/fatherDayDrawTicket.xhtml",data:{},dataType:"json",cache:!1,type:"post",error:function(){errorRemark("网络繁忙，暂时无法领取！")},success:function(n){if(n.returnCode=="0000")redirectUrl("/WeixinService/activity/fartherDayActivity/fartherDaySuccess.shtml");else if(n.returnCode=="0010")redirectUrl("/WeixinService/activity/fartherDayActivity/fartherDayBroughtOut.shtml");else if(n.returnCode=="0020"){var t=[];t=n.returnMsg.split(",");redirectUrl("/WeixinService/activity/fartherDayActivity/fartherDayRepetition.shtml?ticket1="+t[0]+"&ticket2="+t[1])}else n.returnCode=="9998"?errorRemark("关键参数为空"):n.returnCode=="9999"?errorRemark(n.returnMsg):n.returnCode=="8001"?redirectUrl("/WeixinService/weixinLogin/register.shtml?entrance=fartherDayActivity"):errorRemark("网络繁忙，请稍后再试!")}})}$(document).ready(function(){var n,t;activityStatisticalLog("1");n=$(window).height();$(".page,.swiper-wrapper,.swiper-slide").height(n);t=new Swiper(".swiper-container",{pagination:".swiper-pagination",paginationClickable:!0,direction:"vertical",onSlideChangeEnd:function(n){changePaged(n.activeIndex)}})});$(window).resize(function(){var n=$(window).height();$(".page,.swiper-wrapper,.swiper-slide").height(n)})